ass='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja464:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja464:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja464:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja464:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja464:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja464:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja464:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja464:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja464:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja464:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja464:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja464:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja464:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja464:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja464:13.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja464:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja464:0.2": "Dvādasakanipāta ", "ja464:0.3": "Cūḷakuṇālavagga ", "ja464:0.4": "1. Cūḷakuṇālajātaka ", "ja464:1.1": "“Luddhānaṁ lahucittānaṁ, ", "ja464:1.2": "akataññūna dubbhinaṁ; ", "ja464:1.3": "Nādevasatto puriso, ", "ja464:1.4": "thīnaṁ saddhātumarahati. ", "ja464:2.1": "Na tā pajānanti kataṁ na kiccaṁ, ", "ja464:2.2": "Na mātaraṁ pitaraṁ bhātaraṁ vā; ", "ja464:2.3": "Anariyā samatikkantadhammā, ", "ja464:2.4": "Sasseva cittassa vasaṁ vajanti. ", "ja464:3.1": "Cirānuvutthampi piyaṁ manāpaṁ, ", "ja464:3.2": "Anukampakaṁ pāṇasamampi bhattuṁ; ", "ja464:3.3": "Āvāsu kiccesu ca naṁ jahanti, ", "ja464:3.4": "Tasmāhamitthīnaṁ na vissasāmi. ", "ja464:4.1": "Thīnañhi cittaṁ yathā vānarassa, ", "ja464:4.2": "Kannappakannaṁ yathā rukkhachāyā; ", "ja464:4.3": "Calācalaṁ hadayamitthiyānaṁ, ", "ja464:4.4": "Cakkassa nemi viya parivattati. ", "ja464:5.1": "Yadā tā passanti samekkhamānā, ", "ja464:5.2": "Ādeyyarūpaṁ purisassa vittaṁ; ", "ja464:5.3": "Saṇhāhi vācāhi nayanti menaṁ, ", "ja464:5.4": "Kambojakā jalajeneva assaṁ. ", "ja464:6.1": "Yadā na passanti samekkhamānā, ", "ja464:6.2": "Ādeyyarūpaṁ purisassa vittaṁ; ", "ja464:6.3": "Samantato naṁ parivajjayanti, ", "ja464:6.4": "Tiṇṇo nadīpāragatova kullaṁ. ", "ja464:7.1": "Silesūpamā sikhiriva sabbabhakkhā, ", "ja464:7.2": "Tikkhamāyā nadīriva sīghasotā; ", "ja464:7.3": "Sevanti hetā piyamappiyañca, ", "ja464:7.4": "Nāvā yathā orakūlaṁ parañca. ", "ja464:8.1": "Na tā ekassa na dvinnaṁ, ", "ja464:8.2": "āpaṇova pasārito; ", "ja464:8.3": "Yo tā mayhanti maññeyya, ", "ja464:8.4": "vātaṁ jālena bādhaye. ", "ja464:9.1": "Yathā nadī ca pantho ca, ", "ja464:9.2": "pānāgāraṁ sabhā papā; ", "ja464:9.3": "Evaṁ lokitthiyo nāma, ", "ja464:9.4": "velā tāsaṁ na vijjati. ", "ja464:10.1": "Ghatāsanasamā etā, ", "ja464:10.2": "kaṇhasappasirūpamā; ", "ja464:10.3": "Gāvo bahitiṇasseva, ", "ja464:10.4": "omasanti varaṁ varaṁ. ", "ja464:11.1": "Ghatāsanaṁ kuñjaraṁ kaṇhasappaṁ, ", "ja464:11.2": "Muddhābhisittaṁ pamadā ca sabbā; ", "ja464:11.3": "Ete naro niccayato bhajetha, ", "ja464:11.4": "Tesaṁ have dubbidu sabbabhāvo. ", "ja464:12.1": "Naccantavaṇṇā na bahūnaṁ kantā, ", "ja464:12.2": "Na dakkhiṇā pamadā sevitabbā; ", "ja464:12.3": "Na parassa bhariyā na dhanassa hetu, ", "ja464:12.4": "Etitthiyo pañca na sevitabbā”ti. ", "ja464:13.1": "Cūḷakuṇālajātakaṁ paṭhamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja464:0.1": "", "ja464:0.2": "", "ja464:0.3": "", "ja464:0.4": "", "ja464:1.1": "Luddhānaṁ → khuddānaṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja464:1.2": "", "ja464:1.3": "", "ja464:1.4": "", "ja464:2.1": "", "ja464:2.2": "", "ja464:2.3": "", "ja464:2.4": "", "ja464:3.1": "Cirānuvutthampi → cirānuvuṭṭhampi (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja464:3.2": "bhattuṁ → santaṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja464:3.3": "", "ja464:3.4": "", "ja464:4.1": "", "ja464:4.2": "", "ja464:4.3": "", "ja464:4.4": "", "ja464:5.1": "", "ja464:5.2": "", "ja464:5.3": "", "ja464:5.4": "", "ja464:6.1": "", "ja464:6.2": "", "ja464:6.3": "", "ja464:6.4": "", "ja464:7.1": "", "ja464:7.2": "", "ja464:7.3": "", "ja464:7.4": "", "ja464:8.1": "", "ja464:8.2": "", "ja464:8.3": "", "ja464:8.4": "bādhaye → bandhaye (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja464:9.1": "", "ja464:9.2": "", "ja464:9.3": "", "ja464:9.4": "velā tāsaṁ na vijjati → imissā gāthāya pubbaddhāparaddhaṁ vipariyāyena dissati (mr) ", "ja464:10.1": "", "ja464:10.2": "", "ja464:10.3": "", "ja464:10.4": "", "ja464:11.1": "", "ja464:11.2": "", "ja464:11.3": "niccayato → niccayatto (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja464:11.4": "sabbabhāvo → saccabhāvo (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja464:12.1": "", "ja464:12.2": "", "ja464:12.3": "", "ja464:12.4": "", "ja464:13.1": "Cūḷakuṇālajātakaṁ → cullakuṇālajātakaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) "}, "reference_text": {"ja464:0.1": "", "ja464:0.2": "", "ja464:0.3": "", "ja464:0.4": "", "ja464:1.1": "bj30.412, csp1ed22.241, csp2ed22.241, dr27.320, ms22J_2239, msdiv1, ndp22.233, pts-vp-pli5.445, sya27.322, vri68.188", "ja464:1.2": "", "ja464:1.3": "", "ja464:1.4": "", "ja464:2.1": "ms22J_2240, msdiv2", "ja464:2.2": "", "ja464:2.3": "", "ja464:2.4": "", "ja464:3.1": "ms22J_2241, msdiv3", "ja464:3.2": "", "ja464:3.3": "", "ja464:3.4": "", "ja464:4.1": "ms22J_2242, msdiv4", "ja464:4.2": "", "ja464:4.3": "", "ja464:4.4": "", "ja464:5.1": "ms22J_2243, msdiv5, sya27.323", "ja464:5.2": "", "ja464:5.3": "", "ja464:5.4": "", "ja464:6.1": "dr27.321, ms22J_2244, msdiv6", "ja464:6.2": "", "ja464:6.3": "", "ja464:6.4": "", "ja464:7.1": "csp1ed22.242, csp2ed22.242, ms22J_2245, msdiv7, ndp22.234", "ja464:7.2": "", "ja464:7.3": "", "ja464:7.4": "", "ja464:8.1": "ms22J_2246, msdiv8", "ja464:8.2": "", "ja464:8.3": "", "ja464:8.4": "", "ja464:9.1": "bj30.414, ms22J_2247, msdiv9, pts-vp-pli5.446", "ja464:9.2": "", "ja464:9.3": "", "ja464:9.4": "", "ja464:10.1": "ms22J_2248, msdiv10", "ja464:10.2": "", "ja464:10.3": "", "ja464:10.4": "", "ja464:11.1": "ms22J_2249, msdiv11", "ja464:11.2": "", "ja464:11.3": "", "ja464:11.4": "", "ja464:12.1": "dr27.322, ms22J_2250, msdiv12, sya27.324, vri68.189", "ja464:12.2": "", "ja464:12.3": "", "ja464:12.4": "", "ja464:13.1": "ms22J_2251"}, "keys_order": ["ja464:0.1", "ja46